{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55694","headline":"秋日寄人 · 赞宁","name":"秋日寄人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鸟行从山嘴没，青鸥羣向水湄分。\n松斋独坐谁爲侣？数片斜飞槛外云。\n（以上二诗爲张靖龙同志提供，云见南宋陈起《增广圣宋高僧诗选後集》卷上。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赞宁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}